pstack-dsh
==========

pstack skills, adapted for DeepSeek Harness.

This repository is a derivative work of pstack, the plugin that lives in
`cursor/plugins/pstack` of https://github.com/cursor/plugins.

    Upstream author : Poteto
    Upstream source : https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack
    Upstream license: MIT (see LICENSE, which keeps the upstream copyright line)
    Upstream version: see `version` in vendor/pstack/plugin.json

What is original here, and what is not
--------------------------------------

* `vendor/pstack/` is a verbatim snapshot of upstream. It is written by the
  sync workflow only; never edit it by hand.
* `skills/` and `agents/` are generated from `vendor/pstack/` by
  `tools/adapt.mjs`, which applies only the rewrites listed in
  `harness/dsh.md`. Every other byte is upstream's. Do not edit them by hand.
* The DeepSeek Harness adaptation layer is an independent contribution and is
  not endorsed by, affiliated with, or reviewed by the upstream author:
  `extensions/dsh/`, `harness/dsh.md`, `tools/*.mjs`, the sync workflow.

Unofficial. If upstream behaviour and this mirror disagree, upstream is right.